## 7. Fetal Biometry and AI

Fetal biometry is an important application discussed in the review.

The major biometric measurements include:

* Biparietal Diameter (BPD)
* Head Circumference (HC)
* Abdominal Circumference (AC)
* Femur Length (FL)

AI can be used to automatically identify and measure fetal anatomical structures from ultrasound images.

The review discusses the use of models such as convolutional neural networks and Random Forest for automated biometric assessment.

Deep learning can also be used for fetal anatomical segmentation.

