## 11. AI for SGA Detection

The review discusses deep-learning approaches for identifying SGA fetuses using ultrasound data.

One cited study used more than:

**433,000 ultrasound images**

from more than:

**65,000 examinations**.

The reported sensitivity was approximately:

* Deep learning model: **70%**
* Hadlock estimation: **58%**

The reported specificity of the AI model was approximately **91%**.

The review also notes that retrospective and single-center studies may have limited generalizability.

